      "testimonySummary": "Gregory admits that at 21:16 he slipped in by the garden door and stood in the dark hall alcove, six paces from the library door. At 21:17 he heard a heavy thud in the library and saw the light under the door dim."
    },
    {
      "id": "s-gregory-saw-victoria",
      "description": "He saw Lady Victoria leave the library by a lightning flash and the flickers that followed it, lock the door and pocket the key.",
