        "ev-victoria-locks-door"
      ],
      "testimonySummary": "Gregory says that at 21:19, in a lightning flash and the flickers after it, he saw Lady Victoria's face as she stepped out of the library, locked the door, slipped the key into her gown and walked towards the dining room."
